Planning a new build, a renovation, or a siding

70
00:03:33,933 --> 00:03:35,751
replacement in North Vancouver?

71
00:03:35,751 --> 00:03:38,989
We'd be happy to help you choose the right material, and

72
00:03:38,989 --> 00:03:40,466
install it the right way.

73
00:03:41,316 --> 00:03:45,881
Visit silversiding.ca to see more of our work and request a quote.

74
00:03:46,731 --> 00:03:49,385
Thanks for watching. We'll see you on the North Shore.
